      <widget class="QWidget" name="tab4g">
       <attribute name="title">
        <string>4G 配置</string>
       </attribute>
       <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="g4Layout">
        <item>
        <widget class="QGroupBox" name="group4g">
          <property name="title">
           <string>重连策略（只下发到 4G 模块，不写入下位机 EEPROM）</string>
          </property>
          <layout class="QFormLayout" name="g4Form">
           <item row="0" column="0">
            <widget class="QLabel" name="labelSockRstim">
             <property name="text">
              <string>重连间隔（秒）：</string>
             </property>
            </widget>
           </item>
           <item row="0" column="1">
            <widget class="QLineEdit" name="lineSockRstim"/>
           </item>
           <item row="1" column="0">
            <widget class="QLabel" name="labelSockRsnum">
             <property name="text">
              <string>重连次数：</string>
             </property>
            </widget>
           </item>
           <item row="1" column="1">
            <widget class="QLineEdit" name="lineSockRsnum"/>
           </item>
          </layout>
         </widget>
        </item>
        <item>
         <widget class="QLabel" name="label4gHint">
          <property name="text">
           <string>说明：一键配置会读取「参数配置」页 MQTT 组的四项（productKey/deviceKey/deviceSecret/mqtt_addr，来自下位机 EEPROM），逐条下发 AT 指令到 4G 模块；productKey 在模块里没有对应参数，只体现在 13 条 topic 指令中；mqtt_addr 支持“地址:端口”或“地址,端口”。下方重连间隔/次数只用于本次下发（不写入下位机 EEPROM）：留空表示本次不下发（模块保持原值），填了则为 1–65535（0 会被模块拒绝），「全部读取」会连这两项一起从模块读回（模块支持 AT+SOCKRSTIM? / AT+SOCKRSNUM?）。</string>
          </property>
          <property name="wordWrap">
           <bool>true</bool>
          </property>
         </widget>
        </item>
        <item>
         <layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="g4Row1">
          <item>
           <widget class="QPushButton" name="btn4gPush">
            <property name="text">
             <string>全部下发（一键配置）</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item>
           <widget class="QPushButton" name="btn4gRead">
            <property name="text">
             <string>全部读取</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item>
           <widget class="QPushButton" name="btn4gStop">
            <property name="text">
             <string>停止</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item>
           <widget class="QPushButton" name="btnClear4g">
            <property name="text">
             <string>清空日志</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item>
           <spacer name="g4Spacer">
            <property name="orientation">
             <enum>Qt::Horizontal</enum>
            </property>
            <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
             <size>
              <width>40</width>
              <height>20</height>
             </size>
            </property>
           </spacer>
          </item>
         </layout>
        </item>
        <item>
         <layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="g4Row2">
          <item>
           <widget class="QLabel" name="labelProgress">
            <property name="text">
